    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a1 <i>Swifty</i> \u2013 Precision. Speed. Survival.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through challenging levels where speed is everything. <i>Swifty</i> tests your reflexes, timing, and precision in a fast-paced 2D platformer designed for players who love a challenge. Dodge deadly traps, pull off flawless jumps, and perfect your runs. Show that annoying frog who is the real &quot;Swifty&quot; here.<br><strong>\ud83d\udca5 Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced gameplay that rewards precision and speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, responsive controls for smooth movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging levels with deadly obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist art style focused on gameplay clarity</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a1 <i>Swifty</i> \u2013 Precision. Speed. Survival.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through challenging levels where speed is everything. <i>Swifty</i> tests your reflexes, timing, and precision in a fast-paced 2D platformer designed for players who love a challenge. Dodge deadly traps, pull off flawless jumps, and perfect your runs. Show that annoying frog who is the real &quot;Swifty&quot; here.<br><strong>\ud83d\udca5 Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced gameplay that rewards precision and speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, responsive controls for smooth movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging levels with deadly obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist art style focused on gameplay clarity</p></li></ul>",
